WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.952 --> 00:00:18.215
watched in horror as the skinny cat dashed around spectators' legs and darted under chairs.

2
00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:21.356
A big mouse monster stood on his chair.

3
00:00:21.376 --> 00:00:24.097
"Eek! A cat!"

4
00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:26.258
"Woof! Woof!"

5
00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:28.679
Rex-Rex ran after the cat.

6
00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:31.000
The frightened cat streaked toward Mrs.

7
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.573
Hubbletree, who was clutching Bowie protectively to her chest.

8
00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:38.594
The gecko rapidly changed colors to match her colorful dress.

9
00:00:38.614 --> 00:00:40.355
"Watch out, dear!

10
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.455
I'll protect you!"

11
00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:44.216
Mayor Hubbletree pushed his wife out of the way.

12
00:00:44.616 --> 00:00:46.917
He tripped over the cat and fell on his face.

13
00:00:46.937 --> 00:00:50.718
"Ouch!" "I'm sorry!"

14
00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:52.978
Mog yelled, chasing his dog.

15
00:00:52.998 --> 00:00:54.759
"I'm sorry too!"

16
00:00:55.199 --> 00:00:58.000
the cat owner shouted, racing after Mog and the pets.

17
00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.823
"I hope this won't affect my score in the obedience contest!"

18
00:01:02.663 --> 00:01:06.667
Ben could hear Miss Bungle making frantic announcements into the microphone.

19
00:01:07.087 --> 00:01:08.428
But no one was listening.

20
00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:15.454
Then—wham! Rex-Rex crashed into Deb, causing her piranha-keet cage to fly into the air.

21
00:01:16.555 --> 00:01:18.397
More cages crashed to the floor.

22
00:01:19.417 --> 00:01:22.880
Mr. Freaky jumped out of the way, his noses wiggling.

23
00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:24.822
"Ahh!" "Wrawk!

24
00:01:25.022 --> 00:01:26.904
Everything is totally out of control!"

25
00:01:27.376 --> 00:01:29.058
Deb's piranha-keet squawked.

26
00:01:29.918 --> 00:01:32.241
The cat and dog ran around and around.

27
00:01:33.221 --> 00:01:37.685
Near the pet adoption booth, the skinny cat's owner abruptly halted.

28
00:01:37.705 --> 00:01:39.347
"Kitty!" she shouted.

29
00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:40.548
"Come here now!"

30
00:01:41.048 --> 00:01:47.294
"No!" Samantha stood at the booth, holding a ferret with one hand while she held a skeleton dog's

31
00:01:47.354 --> 00:01:48.255
leash with the other.

32
00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:50.977
"Please don't—" But it was too late.

33
00:01:51.337 --> 00:01:53.900
The skinny cat turned and flew at her owner.

34
00:01:55.024 --> 00:01:59.187
But Rex-Rex was still running straight ahead, and—crash!

35
00:01:59.547 --> 00:02:00.968
He slammed into the booth.

36
00:02:01.969 --> 00:02:04.691
Ben gasped as the adoption booth toppled over.

37
00:02:04.711 --> 00:02:08.293
"Whoa!" Mog said.

38
00:02:08.714 --> 00:02:12.876
He called for his dog, who was sniffing around in the stuff from the booth.

39
00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:14.458
"Rex-Rex, come!"

40
00:02:15.358 --> 00:02:17.840
Rex-Rex obediently trotted over to Mog.

41
00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.141
"Look, he found a toy!"

42
00:02:20.562 --> 00:02:21.282
Sid said.

43
00:02:21.302 --> 00:02:23.524
"Good," Mog said.

44
00:02:24.032 --> 00:02:26.093
"Maybe he'll forget about that dumb cat."

45
00:02:26.834 --> 00:02:28.394
Ben grabbed his brother's arm.

46
00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:29.395
"Come on, Sid.

47
00:02:29.675 --> 00:02:32.417
Let's see if we can help Samantha fix the pet adoption booth."

48
00:02:32.877 --> 00:02:36.099
But before they could move, Samantha hurried toward them.

49
00:02:36.119 --> 00:02:37.880
"Excuse me, Mog.

50
00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.221
That toy belongs to the skeleton dog."

51
00:02:41.081 --> 00:02:41.782
She smiled.

52
00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:44.763
"He's an orphan, and that's his only possession."

53
00:02:44.784 --> 00:02:47.225
"Aw. Sorry about that."

54
00:02:47.865 --> 00:02:50.707
Mog got the toy from Rex-Rex and handed it over.

55
00:02:50.727 --> 00:02:54.369
"Thanks," Samantha said with a sigh.

56
00:02:54.389 --> 00:02:56.371
"What a crazy chase, huh?"

57
00:02:56.391 --> 00:02:59.974
"We can help you fix the booth," Ben said.

58
00:03:00.714 --> 00:03:01.795
Her eyes lit up.

59
00:03:01.815 --> 00:03:02.736
"Thank you!"

60
00:03:04.457 --> 00:03:08.540
It took a short time for Ben to help Samantha set up the adoption booth again.

61
00:03:09.101 --> 00:03:12.744
Sid held the ferret and the skeleton dog's leash while Ben worked.

62
00:03:14.205 --> 00:03:19.029
Soon they were back in their seats with Winnie, waiting for the obedience show to continue.

63
00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:23.769
"This is more like a disobedience show," Sid said.

64
00:03:24.389 --> 00:03:25.210
Ben laughed.

65
00:03:26.311 --> 00:03:28.633
"Are you itchy?"

66
00:03:29.013 --> 00:03:31.475
he asked, noticing some fresh green spots.

67
00:03:31.495 --> 00:03:33.497
"Nah. I'm fine.

68
00:03:33.577 --> 00:03:34.938
Look!" Sid added.

69
00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:37.460
"Waldo and Oswald are about to take their turn."

70
00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.323
They watched as Waldo demonstrated what his owl could do.

71
00:03:41.923 --> 00:03:46.107
For once, the owl behaved, following all of Waldo's commands.

72
00:03:47.928 --> 00:03:50.710
Waldo looked proud when he came over with his owl.

73
00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.292
"We killed it!"

74
00:03:52.744 --> 00:03:53.705
Waldo whispered.

75
00:03:53.725 --> 00:03:55.086
"We did so great!"

76
00:03:55.106 --> 00:03:59.149
"Um, Waldo Winnie held Inky tightly.

77
00:03:59.169 --> 00:04:03.352
"Do me a favor and don't mention killing around Oswald, okay?

78
00:04:03.893 --> 00:04:06.895
He might notice the tasty meal that's sitting on my lap right now."

79
00:04:07.896 --> 00:04:13.741
After the judges talked quietly for a few minutes, Miss Bungle announced the obedience contest winner.

80
00:04:14.581 --> 00:04:17.784
It was a spider who could spin fancy webs on command.

81
00:04:22.008 --> 00:04:24.269
"Too bad, guys," Ben said to his friends.

82
00:04:24.289 --> 00:04:26.429
"I thought one of your pets would win."

83
00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.450
Mog shrugged.

84
00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:31.971
"I entered Rex-Rex in the best pet competition too.

85
00:04:32.551 --> 00:04:34.112
Maybe we'll do well in that one."

86
00:04:34.472 --> 00:04:35.092
He grinned.

87
00:04:35.112 --> 00:04:38.033
"I think he's twice as good as any other pet here."

88
00:04:38.053 --> 00:04:39.533
"No way!"

89
00:04:39.853 --> 00:04:40.553
Winnie joked.

90
00:04:40.573 --> 00:04:42.034
"Inky is the best pet."

91
00:04:42.054 --> 00:04:43.974
"Nope, it's Oswald!"

92
00:04:44.194 --> 00:04:45.155
Waldo chimed in.

93
00:04:45.715 --> 00:04:49.376
As the others talked about their pets, Ben saw Sid look down.

94
00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.941
Ben couldn't help feeling bad too.

95
00:04:51.961 --> 00:04:54.022
"Will we ever find a pet?"

96
00:04:54.402 --> 00:04:54.962
he thought.

97
00:04:55.542 --> 00:04:57.143
It sure didn't seem likely.

98
00:04:58.964 --> 00:05:04.666
Ben and Sid finished their volunteer duties and then returned to the stage area to watch the final

99
00:05:04.726 --> 00:05:12.109
event. The room seemed to crackle with excitement—even the zombies were watching the stage alertly, ready to witness

100
00:05:12.149 --> 00:05:13.630
the best pets perform.

101
00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.710
"This is so exciting!"

102
00:05:16.091 --> 00:05:16.771
Winnie said.

103
00:05:17.611 --> 00:05:21.033
As Ben turned to smile at her, Inky let out a hiss.

104
00:05:21.613 --> 00:05:22.854
Ben rolled his eyes.

105
00:05:22.874 --> 00:05:24.315
"Not again, Inky.

106
00:05:24.615 --> 00:05:26.156
This cat really hates me."

107
00:05:26.176 --> 00:05:29.738
"I don't think she hates you," Winnie began.

108
00:05:29.758 --> 00:05:32.400
"She just doesn't—" "Oh no!"

109
00:05:33.161 --> 00:05:35.642
A startled shriek rang out inside the gym.

110
00:05:35.662 --> 00:05:38.464
"Ahh! Bowie is
